[statement]
apk reads a record's names in the order its fields stand: `other` states
`p:` before `D:`, so `xp`, which it provides, is read before `au`, on
which it depends, and `au` comes first of the two, which share a bucket.

[repository]
P:other
V:1
p:xp
D:au

P:base
V:1

P:au
V:1
i:base

P:xp
V:1
i:base

[request]
base

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install base 1
install au 1
install xp 1
